  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Java, Indonesia Earthquake Disaster Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Java, Indonesia experienced a 5.6-magnitude earthquake on the afternoon of November 21, 2022. Initial reports state that over 260 people have died and hundreds more were injured as a result of the disaster. Several thousand homes have been damaged or destroyed and as many as 58,000 people have been displaced. We have begun initial disaster response efforts in the affected areas and will continue to serve these communities with long-term efforts after the initial emergency response.</narrative>
  </description>
